  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "OneLogin",
  "abstract": "Commercial cloud identity and access management product for workforce single sign-on, now the main product of One Identity, which acquired OneLogin in 2021. Acts as an OpenID Connect and SAML identity provider, with an OIDC API that supports the authorization code, implicit, refresh token, password, client credentials and device code flows, PKCE, token introspection and revocation, and dynamic client registration. Sold through sales-quoted plans, with no public price list.",
